{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《璀璨之城》劇情愈來愈激！昨晚（3日）播出一集，Alice（高海寧飾）突然向孝君（吳卓羲飾）投懷送抱，纏綿過後竟反告對方強姦，劇情驚人反轉！原來一切都是其丈夫孝賢（張智霖飾）的陰謀，事件令孝君與其女友Kate（張曦wen飾）極為震驚，究竟這場精心佈置的陷阱會如何收科？\n</p>\n<h2>昨晚驚爆劇情 高海寧借酒澆愁反咬吳卓羲</h2>\n<p>在昨晚（3日）播出的劇情中，Alice（高海寧飾）向孝君（吳卓羲飾）坦白，自己是因為母親芬姨（王綺琴飾）被孝賢（張智霖飾）「軟禁」，才被迫出賣Kate（張曦雯飾）。心煩意亂的Alice借酒澆愁，隨後更主動向孝君投懷送抱，二人發生了關係。然而，這溫存的背後卻是個冷冰冰的陷阱，Alice事後第一時間竟是走去驗身，並向警方報案，指控孝君強姦，讓原本充滿愧疚與同情的孝君瞬間墮入萬劫不復的深淵。</p>\n<h2>一鏡到底拍足三小時 張智霖囂張宣布告強姦</h2>\n<p>劇中最具張力的一幕，莫過於張智霖帶著高海寧，在張曦雯面前高調宣布要告吳卓羲「強姦咗我老婆」。這場戲採用了極為獨特的一鏡到底拍攝手法，鏡頭跟隨四位主角的情緒起伏和走位不斷變化，從全景無縫切換到各人特寫，完美捕捉了張智霖的囂張、高海寧的內疚、張曦雯的震驚暴怒及吳卓羲的不忿。據悉，為了這場數分鐘的重頭戲，四位演員與攝影團隊足足排練了超過三個小時，對白、走位和情緒轉換都必須分秒不差，任何一人出錯就要重來，可見製作之嚴謹。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚神級調度：鏡頭拍出詭異木偶感</h2>\n<p>對於這場戲的演員表現及拍攝手法，網民紛紛給予高度評價，認為四位主角的演出極具感染力。留言洗版式大讚：「好壓抑，大家都演得很好」、「四個主角情緒都好到位，睇得好肉緊！」、「呢場戲真係癲，張力十足」、「鏡頭拍出詭異木偶感，好有電影質素」、「高Ling嘅內疚同無奈，吳卓羲嘅錯愕同憤怒，隔住個mon都feel到！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_20691736406aeabd4ca43ec.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_20691736406aeabd4ca43ec.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_5851051856aeabd4fc61be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_5851051856aeabd4fc61be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_17183935906aeabd5352ddf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_17183935906aeabd5352ddf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_17717958466aeabd55e2552.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_17717958466aeabd55e2552.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_13867029476aeabd5befc24.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_13867029476aeabd5befc24.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_8171248416aeabd5ee681a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_8171248416aeabd5ee681a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/28_17604342636aeabd61e3ff4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/28_17604342636aeabd61e3ff4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/29_2406673096aeabd64c41cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/29_2406673096aeabd64c41cc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/30_10763331906aeabd6959002.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/30_10763331906aeabd6959002.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_17624967166aeabd6c37ea3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_17624967166aeabd6c37ea3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_10630745036aeabd6f2b93c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_10630745036aeabd6f2b93c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/33_14488762966aeabd71e73af.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/33_14488762966aeabd71e73af.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/34_7668635816aeabd757638c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/34_7668635816aeabd757638c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_14624162156aeabd788a20a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_14624162156aeabd788a20a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_19979503536aeabd7c3f186.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_19979503536aeabd7c3f186.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_21442256046aeabd7f244bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_21442256046aeabd7f244bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:45:45.382991+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1149,"images":16,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:30:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:46.589510+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:38:49.620178+00:00","content_hash":"93f4faecfa78d0dc261efc0f57fb4c1c981eb138163a897494da57fca2b30667","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}